    82	| G9(c) caps | pass | 27 characters, about 7 tokens, 8 atoms, 40 intended operations |
    83	
    84	The five failing attacks were high-degree outliers, maximum-common-degree greedy search, 16 random greedy restarts, a parity-blind marker common-neighbor ansatz, and 40-step centered spectral power iteration. The successful exact branch-and-bound solver is correctly reported under `reference_algorithm`, not counted as a failing Track B attack.
    85	
    86	## Oracle loop and G9 diagnostics
    87	
    88	The required harness was invoked, but OpenRouter rejected every draw with HTTP 403 `Key limit exceeded (total limit)`. Per the protocol, API errors are not model failures and no hardness verdict can be claimed.
    89	
    90	| Preset | Seed | Model | Result | Why |
